{
    "comment": "IdP 탭 목록 — 이름, 프로토콜, 상태, 소유 도메인, 마지막 성공·오류, 연결 회원 수. 「IdP 추가」는 프로토콜을 고르는 칸을 연다.\n     서버에서 쓸 수 없는 프로토콜(예: PHP LDAP 확장 없음 — W9)은 배지로 알리고 추가 선택지에서 고를 수 없다. 행의 [편집]은 ?idp={id} 로 같은 화면 편집 보기를 연다.",
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "IdP 목록"
    },
    "layout_name": "partials/plugin_settings/_idp_list",
    "id": "idp_list_tab",
    "type": "basic",
    "name": "Div",
    "if": "{{_computed.activeTab === 'idps' && !query.idp}}",
    "props": {
        "className": "sso:mt-6 sso:space-y-4"
    },
    "children": [
        {
            "id": "idp_list_header",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "props": {
                "className": "sso:flex sso:flex-wrap sso:items-center sso:justify-between sso:gap-2"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "P",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "sso:text-sm sso:text-gray-600 sso:dark:text-gray-400"
                    },
                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-sso.admin.settings.idp.list_hint|count={{ssoIdps?.data?.limits?.count ?? 0}}|max={{ssoIdps?.data?.limits?.max ?? 20}}"
                },
                {
                    "id": "add_idp_button",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Button",
                    "actions": [
                        {
                            "comment": "추가 칸을 연다 — 고를 수 있는 첫 프로토콜을 기본으로 둔다",
                            "type": "click",
                            "handler": "setState",
                            "params": {
                                "target": "local",
                                "showAddIdp": true,
                                "newIdpErrors": null,
                                "newIdp": "{{({ protocol: ((ssoIdps?.data?.protocols ?? []).find(p => p.available)?.key ?? 'oidc'), key: '', label: {} })}}"
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "props": {
                        "type": "button",
                        "className": "sso-btn sso-btn-primary sso:text-sm",
                        "disabled": "{{!_computed.canUpdate || (ssoIdps?.data?.limits?.count ?? 0) >= (ssoIdps?.data?.limits?.max ?? 20)}}"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Icon",
                            "props": {
                                "name": "fa-solid fa-plus",
                                "className": "sso:text-xs"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-sso.admin.settings.idp.add"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "protocol_badges",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "props": {
                "className": "sso:flex sso:flex-wrap sso:gap-2"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Span",
                    "iteration": {
                        "source": "ssoIdps?.data?.protocols ?? []",
                        "item_var": "protocol"
                    },
                    "dataKey": "{{protocol.key}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "{{protocol.available ? 'sso:inline-flex sso:items-center sso:px-2 sso:py-0.5 sso:rounded-full sso:text-xs sso:font-medium sso:bg-gray-100 sso:text-gray-700 sso:dark:bg-gray-700 sso:dark:text-gray-300' : 'sso:inline-flex sso:items-center sso:px-2 sso:py-0.5 sso:rounded-full sso:text-xs sso:font-medium sso:bg-amber-100 sso:text-amber-800 sso:dark:bg-amber-900/30 sso:dark:text-amber-300'}}"
                    },
                    "text": "{{protocol.label + (protocol.available ? '' : ' — ' + $t('sirsoft-sso.admin.settings.idp.protocol_unavailable'))}}"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "comment": "IdP 추가 칸",
            "id": "idp_add_form",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "if": "{{_local.showAddIdp}}",
            "dataKey": "newIdp",
            "props": {
                "className": "sso-admin-card sso:space-y-4"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "H2",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "sso:text-base sso:font-semibold sso:text-gray-900 sso:dark:text-white"
                    },
                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-sso.admin.settings.idp.add_title"
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "responsive": {
                        "768-": {
                            "props": {
                                "className": "sso:grid sso:grid-cols-2 sso:gap-4"
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "props": {
                        "className": "sso:grid sso:grid-cols-1 sso:gap-4"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Label",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "sso-form-label"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-sso.admin.settings.idp.fields.protocol"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Select",
                                    "props": {
                                        "name": "protocol",
                                        "className": "sso:w-full"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Option",
                                            "iteration": {
                                                "source": "ssoIdps?.data?.protocols ?? []",
                                                "item_var": "protocol"
                                            },
                                            "props": {
                                                "value": "{{protocol.key}}",
                                                "disabled": "{{!protocol.available}}"
                                            },
                                            "text": "{{protocol.label}}"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "P",
                                    "if": "{{!!_local.newIdpErrors?.protocol}}",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "sso-form-error"
                                    },
                                    "text": "{{_local.newIdpErrors?.protocol?.[0] ?? ''}}"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Label",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "sso-form-label"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-sso.admin.settings.idp.fields.key"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Input",
                                    "props": {
                                        "type": "text",
                                        "name": "key",
                                        "className": "sso-input",
                                        "placeholder": "hq",
                                        "autoComplete": "off"
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "P",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "sso-form-hint"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-sso.admin.settings.idp.hints.key"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "P",
                                    "if": "{{!!_local.newIdpErrors?.key}}",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "sso-form-error"
                                    },
                                    "text": "{{_local.newIdpErrors?.key?.[0] ?? ''}}"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Label",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "sso-form-label"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-sso.admin.settings.idp.fields.label"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "composite",
                            "name": "MultilingualInput",
                            "props": {
                                "name": "label",
                                "maxLength": 100
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "if": "{{!!_local.newIdpErrors?.label}}",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "sso-form-error"
                            },
                            "text": "{{_local.newIdpErrors?.label?.[0] ?? ''}}"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "sso:flex sso:flex-wrap sso:gap-2"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "id": "add_idp_submit",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Button",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "comment": "꺼진 채로 만든다 — 연결 정보를 채우고 연결 테스트를 한 뒤 편집 보기에서 켠다",
                                    "type": "click",
                                    "handler": "apiCall",
                                    "target": "/api/plugins/sirsoft-sso/admin/idps",
                                    "auth_required": true,
                                    "params": {
                                        "method": "POST",
                                        "body": "{{_local.newIdp}}"
                                    },
                                    "onSuccess": [
                                        {
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "local",
                                                "showAddIdp": false,
                                                "newIdpErrors": null
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "toast",
                                            "params": {
                                                "type": "success",
                                                "message": "$t:sirsoft-sso.admin.settings.idp.created"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "navigate",
                                            "params": {
                                                "path": "/admin/plugins/sirsoft-sso/settings",
                                                "query": {
                                                    "idp": "{{response.data?.id}}"
                                                }
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "onError": [
                                        {
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "local",
                                                "newIdpErrors": "{{error.errors}}"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "toast",
                                            "params": {
                                                "type": "error",
                                                "message": "{{error.message ?? '$t:sirsoft-sso.admin.settings.save_failed'}}"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "type": "button",
                                "className": "sso-btn sso-btn-primary sso:text-sm",
                                "disabled": "{{!_computed.canUpdate}}"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-sso.admin.settings.idp.create"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Button",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "comment": "추가 칸만 닫는다 — 입력한 값은 지우지 않는다",
                                    "type": "click",
                                    "handler": "setState",
                                    "params": {
                                        "target": "local",
                                        "showAddIdp": false
                                    }
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "type": "button",
                                "className": "sso-btn sso-btn-secondary sso:text-sm"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "text": "$t:common.cancel"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "idp_list_loading",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "P",
            "if": "{{!ssoIdps?.data}}",
            "props": {
                "className": "sso:text-sm sso-text-muted"
            },
            "text": "$t:common.loading"
        },
        {
            "id": "idp_list_empty",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "P",
            "if": "{{!!ssoIdps?.data && (ssoIdps?.data?.idps ?? []).length === 0}}",
            "props": {
                "className": "sso-text-hint"
            },
            "text": "$t:sirsoft-sso.admin.settings.idp.empty"
        },
        {
            "id": "idp_datagrid",
            "type": "composite",
            "name": "DataGrid",
            "if": "{{(ssoIdps?.data?.idps ?? []).length > 0}}",
            "props": {
                "data": "{{ssoIdps?.data?.idps ?? []}}",
                "pagination": false,
                "idField": "id",
                "selectable": false,
                "emptyMessage": "$t:sirsoft-sso.admin.settings.idp.empty",
                "columns": [
                    {
                        "field": "display_label",
                        "header": "$t:sirsoft-sso.admin.settings.idp.col.label",
                        "sortable": false,
                        "cellChildren": [
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Div",
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "sso:flex sso:flex-col"
                                },
                                "children": [
                                    {
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "Span",
                                        "props": {
                                            "className": "sso:text-sm sso:font-medium sso:text-gray-900 sso:dark:text-white"
                                        },
                                        "text": "{{row.display_label}}"
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "Span",
                                        "props": {
                                            "className": "sso:text-xs sso-text-muted"
                                        },
                                        "text": "{{row.key}}"
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "protocol",
                        "header": "$t:sirsoft-sso.admin.settings.idp.col.protocol",
                        "sortable": false,
                        "width": "110px",
                        "cellChildren": [
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "sso:text-sm sso:text-gray-700 sso:dark:text-gray-300"
                                },
                                "text": "{{row.protocol_label}}"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "enabled",
                        "header": "$t:sirsoft-sso.admin.settings.idp.col.status",
                        "sortable": false,
                        "width": "130px",
                        "cellChildren": [
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Div",
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "sso:flex sso:flex-wrap sso:gap-1"
                                },
                                "children": [
                                    {
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "Span",
                                        "if": "{{row.enabled}}",
                                        "props": {
                                            "className": "sso:inline-flex sso:items-center sso:px-2 sso:py-0.5 sso:rounded-full sso:text-xs sso:font-medium sso:bg-green-100 sso:text-green-800 sso:dark:bg-green-900/30 sso:dark:text-green-300"
                                        },
                                        "text": "$t:sirsoft-sso.admin.settings.idp.enabled"
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "Span",
                                        "if": "{{!row.enabled}}",
                                        "props": {
                                            "className": "sso:inline-flex sso:items-center sso:px-2 sso:py-0.5 sso:rounded-full sso:text-xs sso:font-medium sso:bg-gray-100 sso:text-gray-700 sso:dark:bg-gray-700 sso:dark:text-gray-300"
                                        },
                                        "text": "$t:sirsoft-sso.admin.settings.idp.disabled"
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "Span",
                                        "if": "{{!row.available}}",
                                        "props": {
                                            "className": "sso:inline-flex sso:items-center sso:px-2 sso:py-0.5 sso:rounded-full sso:text-xs sso:font-medium sso:bg-amber-100 sso:text-amber-800 sso:dark:bg-amber-900/30 sso:dark:text-amber-300"
                                        },
                                        "text": "$t:sirsoft-sso.admin.settings.idp.unavailable"
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "Span",
                                        "if": "{{row.enforce_owned_domains}}",
                                        "props": {
                                            "className": "sso:inline-flex sso:items-center sso:px-2 sso:py-0.5 sso:rounded-full sso:text-xs sso:font-medium sso:bg-indigo-100 sso:text-indigo-800 sso:dark:bg-indigo-900/30 sso:dark:text-indigo-300"
                                        },
                                        "text": "$t:sirsoft-sso.admin.settings.idp.enforced"
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "owned_domains",
                        "header": "$t:sirsoft-sso.admin.settings.idp.col.domains",
                        "sortable": false,
                        "cellChildren": [
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "sso:text-xs sso:text-gray-700 sso:dark:text-gray-300 sso:break-all sso-break-all"
                                },
                                "text": "{{(row.owned_domains ?? []).join(', ') || '-'}}"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "last_success_at",
                        "header": "$t:sirsoft-sso.admin.settings.idp.col.last",
                        "sortable": false,
                        "width": "190px",
                        "cellChildren": [
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Div",
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "sso:flex sso:flex-col sso:text-xs"
                                },
                                "children": [
                                    {
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "Span",
                                        "props": {
                                            "className": "sso:text-gray-700 sso:dark:text-gray-300"
                                        },
                                        "text": "{{$t('sirsoft-sso.admin.settings.idp.last_success')}}: {{row.last_success_at | datetime | default('-')}}"
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "Span",
                                        "props": {
                                            "className": "{{row.last_error_at ? 'sso:text-red-700 sso:dark:text-red-300' : 'sso-text-muted'}}"
                                        },
                                        "text": "{{$t('sirsoft-sso.admin.settings.idp.last_error')}}: {{row.last_error_at | datetime | default('-')}}{{row.last_error_at && row.last_error_code ? ' (' + row.last_error_code + ')' : ''}}"
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "accounts_active",
                        "header": "$t:sirsoft-sso.admin.settings.idp.col.accounts",
                        "sortable": false,
                        "width": "90px",
                        "cellChildren": [
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "sso:text-sm sso:text-gray-700 sso:dark:text-gray-300"
                                },
                                "text": "{{row.accounts_active}}"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "id",
                        "header": "",
                        "sortable": false,
                        "width": "90px",
                        "cellChildren": [
                            {
                                "id": "edit_idp_{{row.id}}",
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Button",
                                "actions": [
                                    {
                                        "comment": "같은 화면의 편집 보기 — 주소에 idp 를 실어 새로고침에도 유지한다",
                                        "type": "click",
                                        "handler": "navigate",
                                        "params": {
                                            "path": "/admin/plugins/sirsoft-sso/settings",
                                            "query": {
                                                "idp": "{{row.id}}"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    }
                                ],
                                "props": {
                                    "type": "button",
                                    "className": "sso-btn sso-btn-secondary sso:text-xs",
                                    "aria-label": "$t:defer:sirsoft-sso.admin.settings.idp.edit_named|idp={{row.display_label}}"
                                },
                                "children": [
                                    {
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "Span",
                                        "text": "$t:sirsoft-sso.admin.settings.idp.edit"
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    ]
}
